{"title":"2026年四大重点任务定了！住建部最新部署！","date":"2025-12-26","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h1 class=\"rich_media_title \" id=\"activity-name\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 22px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); line-height: 1.4; user-select: text; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t2026年四大重点任务定了！住建部最新部署！</h1>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); margin-bottom: 0px;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"text-align:center;margin:0px 0px 20px;line-height:0;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block;line-height:0;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100% !important;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"text-align:left;justify-content:flex-start;display:flex;flex-flow:row;margin:10px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;align-self:flex-start;flex:0 0 auto;min-width:5%;height:auto;background-image:linear-gradient(0deg, rgb(190, 19, 27) 13%, rgb(238, 40, 32) 88%);border-top-left-radius:45%;overflow:hidden;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100% !important;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: inline-block; width: 181px; height: 40px; vertical-align: top; overflow: hidden; border-top-left-radius: 99%; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"text-align:justify;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"text-align:center;justify-content:center;display:flex;flex-flow:row;margin:-20px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:100%;vertical-align:top;align-self:flex-start;flex:0 0 auto;padding:0px 25px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin:5px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgba(62, 62, 62, 0.79);font-size:15px;line-height:2;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:17px;\">12月22日至23日，全国住房城乡建设工作会议在北京召开。会<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">议</span><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(192, 0, 30); box-sizing: border-box;\">全面盘点2025年工作</span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">，系</span>统总结&ldquo;十四<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">五&rdquo;时期住房城乡建设事业发展成就，包括城市更新进展、保交房、&ldquo;中国建造&rdquo;、&ldquo;好房子&rdquo;建设等方面。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:17px;\">会议同时<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(192, 0, 30); box-sizing: border-box;\">研究部署</span></strong><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(192, 0, 30); box-sizing: border-box;\">&ldquo;十五五&rdquo;时期和2026年重点任务</span></strong>，会议指出，2026年要着力抓好<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(192, 0, 30); box-sizing: border-box;\">推进现代化人民城市建设、着力稳定房地产市场、加快建筑业提质升级、夯实高质量发展基础支撑</span></strong>等4方面工作。住房城乡建设部党组书记、部长倪虹作工作报告，部党组成员、副部长、总师出席会议。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"transform-style:flat;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;transform:perspective(0px);-webkit-transform:perspective(0px);-moz-transform:perspective(0px);-ms-transform:perspective(0px);-o-transform:perspective(0px);\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"text-align:left;justify-content:flex-start;display:flex;flex-flow:row;margin:10px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;transform:rotateX(180deg) rotateY(180deg);-webkit-transform:rotateX(180deg) rotateY(180deg);-moz-transform:rotateX(180deg) rotateY(180deg);-ms-transform:rotateX(180deg) rotateY(180deg);-o-transform:rotateX(180deg) rotateY(180deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;align-self:flex-start;flex:0 0 auto;min-width:5%;height:auto;background-image:linear-gradient(0deg, rgb(190, 19, 27) 13%, rgb(238, 40, 32) 88%);border-top-left-radius:45%;overflow:hidden;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100% !important;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: inline-block; width: 181px; height: 40px; vertical-align: top; overflow: hidden; border-top-left-radius: 99%; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"text-align:justify;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"line-height:0;text-align:center;margin:30px 0px 20px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section data-width=\"95%\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block;line-height:0;width:95%;height:auto;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100% !important;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<img data-width=\"100%\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202512/1-1(1).png\" style=\"vertical-align: bottom; width: 100%; border-radius: initial; background-color: transparent !important; background-size: 0px !important;\" /></p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin:0px 0px 20px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size:15px;color:rgba(62, 62, 62, 0.79);line-height:2;padding:0px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:17px;\">会议强调，2025年中央城市工作会议胜利召开，擘画了建设创新、宜居、美丽、韧性、文明、智慧的现代化人民城市宏伟蓝图。各有关部门加快出台配套文件，构建推动城市高质量发展的&ldquo;1+N&rdquo;政策体系。<span style=\"color: rgb(192, 0, 30); box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">全国19个省份召开城市工作会议，8个省份已出台贯彻落实文件</strong></span>。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin:20px 0px 25px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size:15px;color:rgba(62, 62, 62, 0.79);line-height:2;padding:0px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:17px;\">会议指出，<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(192, 0, 30); box-sizing: border-box;\">2026年，要着力抓好4方面工作</span></strong>。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin:10px 0% -20px;text-align:left;justify-content:flex-start;display:flex;flex-flow:row;box-sizing:border-box;transform:translate3d(20px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform:translate3d(20px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform:translate3d(20px, 0px, 0px);-ms-transform:translate3d(20px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform:translate3d(20px, 0px, 0px);\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;min-width:10%;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;align-self:flex-start;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100% !important;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"text-align:justify;justify-content:flex-start;display:flex;flex-flow:row;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;min-width:10%;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;background-color:rgb(234, 44, 44);align-self:flex-start;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100% !important;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"color:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.99);padding:0px 10px;letter-spacing:1px;line-height:1.3;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;box-sizing:border-box;\">2026&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">/ &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:17px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">推进现代化人民城市建设</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size:0px;margin:0px 0%;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:0px;height:0px;vertical-align:top;overflow:hidden;border-style:solid;border-width:3px;border-color:rgb(234, 44, 44) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgb(234, 44, 44);box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\"></svg></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"margin:0px 0% 10px;text-align:left;justify-content:flex-start;display:flex;flex-flow:row;width:100%;border-left:2px solid #ea2c2c;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 2px;align-self:flex-start;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"text-align:justify;justify-content:flex-start;display:flex;flex-flow:row;margin:0px 0px 20px;width:100%;border-width:0px 0px 0px 1px;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;border-left-color:#ffac3f;background-color:#fffaf3fc;align-self:flex-start;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"margin:30px 0% 10px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"padding:0px 20px;line-height:2;font-size:14px;color:rgba(62, 62, 62, 0.79);width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;text-indent:2.57143em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:17px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">高质量开展城市更新</strong>，编制实施&ldquo;十五五&rdquo;城市更新专项规划，抓好城市体检、更新试点，实施一批民生工程、发展工程、安全工程。以&ldquo;绣花&rdquo;功夫精细化推进城镇老旧小区改造、完整社区建设、口袋公园建设、绿地开放共享、&ldquo;温暖工程&rdquo;建设、城市小微公共空间改造，提升无障碍适老化环境品质。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;text-indent:2.57143em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:17px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">高质量实施&ldquo;两重&rdquo;、&ldquo;两新&rdquo;项目建设</strong>，持续开展地下管网改造和综合管廊建设，常态化推进城市燃气管道老化更新改造，力争完成改造各类燃气管道3万公里。积极开展新型城市基础设施建设。持续建设城市排水防涝工程体系、城市基础设施生命线安全工程。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;text-indent:2.57143em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:17px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">高效能推进城市治理</strong>，推动建立城市管理统筹协调机制，发挥好&ldquo;一委一办一平台&rdquo;作用，深入开展城市管理进社区工作，运用好&ldquo;吹哨报到&rdquo;、&ldquo;接诉即办&rdquo;等工作机制，深化城市管理和执法体制改革，持续推进城市管理执法队伍标准化规范化建设。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;text-indent:2.57143em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:17px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">高标准建设文明城市</strong>，完善历史文化保护传承体系，全力抓好老城区和老街区专项调查，深入开展国家历史文化名城专项评估和监测，完善城市风貌管理制度，以民生小事实事为载体弘扬传统美德、培育城市精神。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent:2.57143em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:17px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">高水平推动城乡融合发展</strong>，建设宜居县城，加强边境小城镇建设，巩固农村危房改造成果，开展传统村落特色保护区试点，继续做好定点帮扶和对口支援工作。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin:10px 0% -20px;text-align:left;justify-content:flex-start;display:flex;flex-flow:row;box-sizing:border-box;transform:translate3d(20px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform:translate3d(20px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform:translate3d(20px, 0px, 0px);-ms-transform:translate3d(20px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform:translate3d(20px, 0px, 0px);\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;min-width:10%;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;align-self:flex-start;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100% !important;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"text-align:justify;justify-content:flex-start;display:flex;flex-flow:row;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;min-width:10%;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;background-color:rgb(234, 44, 44);align-self:flex-start;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100% !important;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"color:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.99);padding:0px 10px;letter-spacing:1px;line-height:1.3;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;box-sizing:border-box;\">2026&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">/ &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:17px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">着力稳定房地产市场</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size:0px;margin:0px 0%;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:0px;height:0px;vertical-align:top;overflow:hidden;border-style:solid;border-width:3px;border-color:rgb(234, 44, 44) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgb(234, 44, 44);box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\"></svg></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"margin:0px 0% 10px;text-align:left;justify-content:flex-start;display:flex;flex-flow:row;width:100%;border-left:2px solid #ea2c2c;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 2px;align-self:flex-start;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"text-align:justify;justify-content:flex-start;display:flex;flex-flow:row;margin:0px 0px 20px;width:100%;border-width:0px 0px 0px 1px;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;border-left-color:#ffac3f;background-color:#fffaf3fc;align-self:flex-start;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"margin:30px 0% 10px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"padding:0px 20px;line-height:2;font-size:14px;color:rgba(62, 62, 62, 0.79);width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;text-indent:2.57143em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:17px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">因城施策控增量、去库存、优供给</strong>，结合城市更新、城中村改造盘活利用存量用地，推动收购存量商品房用作保障性住房、安置房、宿舍、人才房等。优化和精准实施保障性住房供应，实施房屋品质提升工程，有序推进&ldquo;好房子&rdquo;建设。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;text-indent:2.57143em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:17px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">进一步发挥房地产项目&ldquo;白名单&rdquo;制度作用</strong>。城市政府要用足用好房地产调控自主权，适时调整优化房地产政策，支持居民刚性和改善性住房需求，推动房地产市场平稳运行。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent:2.57143em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:17px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">加快构建房地产发展新模式</strong>，有序搭建基础性制度，在房地产开发上，做实房地产开发项目公司制。在房地产融资上，推行主办银行制。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin:10px 0% -20px;text-align:left;justify-content:flex-start;display:flex;flex-flow:row;box-sizing:border-box;transform:translate3d(20px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform:translate3d(20px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform:translate3d(20px, 0px, 0px);-ms-transform:translate3d(20px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform:translate3d(20px, 0px, 0px);\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;min-width:10%;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;align-self:flex-start;box-sizing:border-box;m